window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-088-365657a907335686.json"]={sha256:"365657a907335686a4344d858d68343dfe70b1491cd5f8e3813600a1c0ffa08d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-e833f3b2aaa060ff","url":"https://docs.velociraptor.app/docs/clients/artifacts/","title":"Velociraptor artifact collections","titleEn":"Velociraptor artifact collections","publisher":"Velociraptor","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-088","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-088","related":[{"id":"security-v26-089","referenceUrls":["https://volatility3.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"],"title":"Volatility 3：記憶體視圖差異與證據限制","titleEn":"Volatility 3: memory-view differences and evidence limits","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付artifact範圍、20台合成清單、容量預算、單台試驗與失敗處理表。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver artifact scope, twenty-host synthetic inventory, volume budget, pilot results and failure handling.","difference":"比較不同列舉方式的程序識別、建立時間與父子關係，將差異視為調查起點而非直接定罪。","differenceEn":"Compare process identity, creation time and parentage across enumeration methods, treating differences as leads rather than verdicts.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["理想傳輸下界=總資料/有效頻寬；另加固定蒐集準備時間，不能混用MB與MiB。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 20台合成主機每台150MB，串行準備各2秒，共用有效傳輸50MB/秒；使用十進位MB。 資料3000MB，傳輸下界60秒，準備40秒，簡化總下界100秒。","對稱差=集合A大小+集合B大小−2×交集；差異也可能來自結束程序、損壞或解析限制。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 合成視圖A有40個程序，B有44個，共同38個；以PID加建立時間作身分鍵。 聯集46個，對稱差40+44−2×38=8個。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ideal transfer lower bound is total data divided by effective bandwidth; add setup time separately and distinguish MB from MiB. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Twenty synthetic hosts each produce 150 decimal MB, with two seconds of serial setup each and shared effective transfer of 50 MB/s. Data totals 3000 MB; transfer lower bound is sixty seconds plus forty seconds setup, totaling one hundred seconds.","Symmetric difference=|A|+|B|−2|intersection|; differences may reflect exited processes, corruption or parsing limits. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Synthetic view A contains forty processes and B forty-four, sharing thirty-eight; identity is PID plus creation time. The union has forty-six entries and the symmetric difference is eight.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-098","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/34/r1/upd1/final"],"title":"NIST BIA：RTO、RPO與服務復原目標","titleEn":"NIST BIA: RTO, RPO and service recovery objectives","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付artifact範圍、20台合成清單、容量預算、單台試驗與失敗處理表。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver artifact scope, twenty-host synthetic inventory, volume budget, pilot results and failure handling.","difference":"分開最大可容忍中斷、RTO與RPO，列出資料重建成本及必要外部相依。","differenceEn":"Distinguish maximum tolerable disruption, RTO and RPO, recording data reconstruction cost and external dependencies.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["理想傳輸下界=總資料/有效頻寬；另加固定蒐集準備時間，不能混用MB與MiB。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 20台合成主機每台150MB，串行準備各2秒，共用有效傳輸50MB/秒；使用十進位MB。 資料3000MB，傳輸下界60秒，準備40秒，簡化總下界100秒。","最壞資料時間損失可用成功備份間隔作簡化上界，但必須考慮備份失敗；RTO另含還原與驗證。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 目標RPO15分鐘、RTO90分鐘；本簡化模型假設中斷立即被偵測並宣告，無額外等待。備份每10分鐘成功一次，還原50分鐘、驗證25分鐘、切換10分鐘。 理想RPO上界10分鐘符合15；復原總85分鐘，距RTO剩5分鐘裕度。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ideal transfer lower bound is total data divided by effective bandwidth; add setup time separately and distinguish MB from MiB. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Twenty synthetic hosts each produce 150 decimal MB, with two seconds of serial setup each and shared effective transfer of 50 MB/s. Data totals 3000 MB; transfer lower bound is sixty seconds plus forty seconds setup, totaling one hundred seconds.","A successful backup interval can approximate a worst-case data-time loss bound, but failures matter; RTO separately includes restore and validation. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Targets are RPO fifteen minutes and RTO ninety minutes; this simplified model assumes immediate detection and declaration at disruption, with no extra waiting. Successful backups occur every ten minutes, with fifty-minute restore, twenty-five-minute validation and ten-minute cutover. Ideal RPO bound is ten minutes, meeting fifteen; recovery totals eighty-five minutes with five minutes of RTO margin.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-81775cce479382d9","url":"https://volatility3.readthedocs.io/en/stable/","title":"Volatility 3 documentation","titleEn":"Volatility 3 documentation","publisher":"Volatility Foundation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-f561a6295e1b6a09","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/34/r1/upd1/final","title":"NIST SP 800-34r1 contingency planning","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-34r1 contingency planning","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
